@startuml
title T12-WF12 — AI Quote & Proposal Agent (Sequence)
autonumber
actor "Sales User/UI" as UI
participant "NestJS Quote Request API" as API
participant "n8n WF12\nQuote & Proposal" as N8N
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Product/Pricing Catalog" as CATALOG
participant "Gemini API" as AI
participant "NestJS Review Module" as APPROVAL

UI -> API: POST quote/proposal draft request
API -> API: Authenticate Sales role and authorize customer/lead access
API -> DB: Create WorkflowRun/request record
DB --> API: workflowRunId
API --> UI: 202 Accepted + workflowRunId
API -> N8N: POST protected internal webhook with scoped requirements/run ID
activate N8N
N8N -> N8N: Validate customer ID, requirements and item list
N8N -> API: GET customer context
API -> DB: Read customer record
DB --> API: Customer context
API --> N8N: Customer context
N8N -> API: GET catalog/pricing data
API -> CATALOG: Resolve available catalog (real or explicitly marked demo)
CATALOG --> API: Known product IDs and authoritative prices, or demo data marker
API --> N8N: Catalog and provenance
N8N -> N8N: Map requested items to known catalog identifiers
N8N -> AI: Draft non-authoritative proposal wording/structure
AI --> N8N: Proposal draft text + referenced items
N8N -> N8N: Validate returned IDs/quantities; reject invented items
N8N -> API: POST price-validation request
API -> API: Calculate totals/tax/discount constraints deterministically
API --> N8N: Authoritative calculated totals and approval requirements
N8N -> N8N: Mark draft/approval state
N8N -> API: Save quote/proposal draft
API -> DB: Persist draft with catalog version and price snapshot
DB --> API: quoteId
API --> N8N: quoteId
alt Approval required
  N8N -> APPROVAL: Create/ensure ReviewTask for quoteId
  APPROVAL -> DB: Persist approval task idempotently with quote target reference
  DB --> APPROVAL: Task ID
  APPROVAL --> N8N: Pending approval
else No approval needed for draft
  N8N -> N8N: Keep as draft until explicitly approved for customer delivery
end
N8N -> API: Record workflow status/output
API -> DB: Update WorkflowRun
DB --> API: Status
API --> N8N: Saved status
deactivate N8N
UI -> API: GET quote/proposal result by workflowRunId
API -> DB: Read quote/run/approval state
DB --> API: Draft and approval status
API --> UI: Draft, quoteId, price provenance and approval status
note over API,N8N
The browser reaches NestJS first. The internal n8n webhook is authenticated and not
exposed as a public client endpoint. Pricing and approval policy remain backend-owned.
ReviewTask references quotes through its validated polymorphic target fields.
end note

note over APPROVAL,DB
ReviewTask links to a quote by setting `target_entity_type=Quote` and `target_entity_id` to the quote UUID. NestJS validates the target type against the allowlist, confirms the quote exists, and enforces authorization, approval policy, idempotency and audit.
end note
@enduml
